<title>UK: CESP sets $300 mln 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>CESP sets $300 mln 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMPANHIA ENERGECTICA DE SAO PAULO (CESP)</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON   * 9.125     MATURITY  * 26.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    26.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+280 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>	     *STEPS UP TO 9.625 PCT AFTER YEAR FIVE IF NOT CALLED</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
